   "text": "Rafael, \"prod-db-readonly\" does exist. It's the production database (read-only) group, so you can stop checking with your tech lead on the name. I can't add you to it, though.\n\nThe group is classed as privileged. Contractors can't hold privileged access, and no approval can override that. I haven't requested any approvals for it.\n\nIf you need data to debug the ingestion pipeline, ask your manager, Ingrid Solberg, about other options. Examples are a sanitized or staging dataset, or a full-time teammate running the queries for you. I can help with access to standard or sensitive groups that don't involve production data."
